From 419aa84ededad458323d607eefaed6f76f8bd0cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emma Anholt <anholt@igalia.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:43:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: Make register usage header generation deterministic

The register generator iterates a Python set when collecting per-variant
usage arrays. Different hash seeds change the order of the generated C++
templates. A C consumer also gets different header checksums in DWARF,
which changes msm.ko and its build ID in otherwise identical builds.

Backport Emma Anholt's Mesa change, "freedreno: Ensure that the
generated pack headers are stable between builds.", by sorting variants
before collecting usage arrays. Preserve every array key and register
offset.

Five hash seeds produce two distinct baseline headers on the Fx0 source
and three on current mainline. Each fixed generator produces one header;
all array contents and all other declarations remain unchanged.

The original Mesa change was marked Generated-by: LLM. Codex assisted
this Linux reproduction, backport validation and commit description.

Fixes: 5acf49119630 ("drm/msm: import gen_header.py script from Mesa")
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/c09c414563fc0fe6788f28ee7a35522ab21d0ed5
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/gen_header.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/gen_header.py b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/gen_header.py
index d3b56a9d84fb..5a738a2ad173 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/gen_header.py
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/registers/gen_header.py
@@ -816,7 +816,7 @@ class Parser(object):
                         if reg == vreg:
                             d[(usage, sanitize_variant(variant))].append(reg)
                 else:
-                    for variant in self.variants:
+                    for variant in sorted(self.variants):
                         d[(usage, sanitize_variant(variant))].append(reg)
 
         print("#ifdef __cplusplus")

base-commit: d024361c631b3f020a26c07d683e5103404b0fbf
